# National Endowment for the Humanities Sixth Annual Report.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This annual report discusses the status of programs created to broaden the uses of the humanities by the American public. Included in the discussion is an experimental program on a statewide basis for informal adult education in the humanities and The Jefferson Lecture in the Humanities, a national series which will bring humanistic learning directly to bear on public affairs. (Author/CK)

